  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communities in Ethiopia overcome poverty through</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the project is to empower vulnerable people in two regions within Ethiopia (Oromia and South Regional State) to lift themselves out of poverty through climate adaptive agriculture, business development and establishing civil society organisations. There is a special emphasis on women, girls and people living with disabilities. Tearfund Ireland will pursue their objectives through capacity building and training including on conservation and sustainable organic agriculture.</narrative>
  </description>
